  "notes": "{達成|たっせい} means achievement or accomplishment of a goal. Functions as noun or ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb.\n\nFORMS:\n{達|たっ} (reach) + {成|せい} (accomplish).\n\nUSAGE AS VERB:\n{達成|たっせい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to achieve, to accomplish.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{目標|もくひょう}→目標：03631_mokuhyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{達成|たっせい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to achieve a goal\n- ⟦{達成感|たっせいかん}→達成感：05952_tasseikan⟧: sense of accomplishment\n- {達成|たっせい}⟦{度|ど}→〜度：09845_do⟧: degree of achievement\n- {達成|たっせい}⟦{率|りつ}→率：03802_ritsu⟧: achievement rate\n\nCONTEXT: Common in business (sales targets), education, and personal goals.",
